# Skool MCP configuration TEMPLATE.
#
# You do not fill this in by hand. Run `uv run connect_skool.py`: it opens a
# browser, you log into Skool yourself, and it writes your real values into a
# file called `.env` next to this one.
#
# `.env` holds a live login to your Skool account. Anyone who has it is you.
# NEVER share it, paste it into a chat, screenshot it, email it, or commit it.
# It is listed in .gitignore so git will not pick it up. Keep it that way.

# The full Cookie header from your logged-in Skool session.
# Written by connect_skool.py, kept fresh by refresh_cookie.py.
SKOOL_COOKIE=

# Your community's slug: the part after skool.com/ in the URL.
# https://www.skool.com/my-community  ->  my-community
SKOOL_GROUP=

# Optional. Skool's internal id for that community.
# Leave it blank. The client resolves it from SKOOL_GROUP on the first call and
# caches it for the rest of the session. Set it only to skip that one lookup.
SKOOL_GROUP_ID=
